In article <1991Nov5.162224.4630@athena.mit.edu> bjohnson@athena.mit.edu (Brett W Johnson) writes:
>Anyone know an ftp site with the spoiler file for OMEGA?

*What* omega spoilers?  Are there any?  For that matter, is it worth it?

After spending three months making extensive modifications to omega my
freshman year and about a year thereafter defending the game, I decided
that it wasn't worth it.  Omega had a lot of really cool ideas, but the
game was *poorly* written and *extremely* buggy.  To top it all off, the
creator/writer has totally abandoned the game and could really care less
about what happens to it.

We originally had plans to create an omega spoiler file in addition to
the nethack spoiler file, but nethack is just so much of a bigger/better
game that we never got around to it.

